         <p>Turning Ideas into Interactive Realities
           Hey there! I’m Kush Pandit, a 16-year-old full stack web developer from Gujarat, India. I started my coding
           journey at a young age, driven by curiosity and a desire to create something unique on the internet. Over time,
           I’ve developed a strong skill set in both frontend and backend development, working with technologies like HTML,
           CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, and more. Even though I’m still in school (10th grade), my love for coding
