     <section id="services">
       <h2>What i do <span>Some of my Work</span></h2>
       <div class="main-did-div">
         <div class="did-div">
           <img src="./assets/11836104.png" alt="icon1">
           <h3>Frontend Development</h3>
           <p>
             I specialize in creating interactive and visually appealing user interfaces using modern frontend technologies
             like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and frameworks such as React. My focus is on building responsive designs that work
             seamlessly across all devices while ensuring smooth user experiences, performance optimization, and
             accessibility. Every pixel and transition is thoughtfully implemented to reflect professionalism and
             creativity.
           </p>
         </div>
         <div class="did-div"><img src="./assets/11836194.png" alt="icon1">
           <h3>Backend Development</h3>
           <p>
             With a strong grasp of backend technologies like Node.js, Express, and database systems such as MongoDB and
             MySQL, I develop powerful and scalable server-side applications. I handle APIs, authentication, data handling,
             and logic implementation to ensure secure and efficient operations. My goal is to build systems that are not
             only functional but also easy to maintain and expand as needed.</p>
         </div>
         <div class="did-div"><img src="./assets/11836074.png" alt="icon1">
           <h3>Freelancing</h3>
           <p>
             As a freelancer, I collaborate with clients globally to turn their ideas into fully functioning digital
             products. From small personal projects to professional websites and web apps, I provide end-to-end development
             services. I value communication, timely delivery, and clean code, ensuring that each project meets client
             expectations and business goals.</p>
         </div>
         <div class="did-div"><img src="./assets/11836144.png" alt="icon1">
           <h3>Content creator</h3>
           <p>
             I enjoy sharing knowledge and ideas through content creation focused on programming, web development, and
             technology. Whether it's through informative posts, reels, or tutorials, I aim to educate and inspire others
             who are on their coding journey. My content is designed to be engaging, easy to understand, and helpful for
             learners at all levels.</p>
         </div>
         <div class="did-div"><img src="./assets/11836224.png" alt="icon1">
           <h3>Logo Designing</h3>
           <p>
             I create custom logo designs that blend creativity with clarity. My process involves understanding the brand,
             exploring concepts, and delivering designs that are unique, versatile, and memorable. Whether it’s minimal or
             detailed, I ensure the logo reflects the brand identity and leaves a strong impression on the audience.</p>
         </div>
         <div class="did-div"><img src="./assets/11836164.png" alt="icon1">
           <h3>Database Handling</h3>
           <p>
             I work with both SQL and NoSQL databases to store, retrieve, and manage data efficiently. From designing
             schemas to writing queries and managing large datasets, I ensure that the data layer of any application is
             secure, organized, and optimized for performance. I also integrate databases smoothly with backend services
             for seamless data flow.
           </p>
         </div>
       </div>
